// Pattern: 0524-2
// Author: Seunghun LEE
// SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0
// Date: 2026-05-24
// Lineage: AI generated and curated
//
// Liquid Ripple Refraction
// Using virtual aspherical water droplet waves falling on the center and edges of the screen, 
