// Knob 1: Boundary Scaling Factor (0..1)
// Knob 2: Animation Speed (0.1..10.0) [Clamped, No Wrap]
// Knob 3: Sub-division Complexity Grid (0.0..4.9) [Clamped, No Wrap]
